  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "燈仔花"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張日東</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Nǹg過時間ê磅空</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hiàm醒tuh-ku--去ê記憶</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">囡仔時tsūn ê你　kám m̄ bat</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">挽阮ê花心黏tī鼻</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">扮hit-lō阿啄仔mā真趣味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">五瓣喙脣胭脂點紅紅</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一支喙舌tuè風leh tín動</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">熱情是我ê姓</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大pān是我ê名</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">紅kì-kì是阮親hòo-hòo ê標頭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Hawaii</i> ê suí姑娘仔kā阮插tsiūnn頭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Malaysia</i>國花上kài有pān頭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮是tsiah-nī美麗ê花蕊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Thài ē有人講阮大紅花bái m̄知</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">世間怎有hit-lō代</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">春天</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">尾蝶伴阮跳出青春ê舞步</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮kā花園妝thānn kah上tshia-iānn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">熱--人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Am-poo-tsê大聲leh huah m̄甘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄甘阮ê喙phué hōo南風</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">siàn kah紅kòng-kòng</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">秋凊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit个上gâu怨妒--阮ê楓仔樹</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊kā青衫褪掉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">緊mé換一軀紅衫</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">beh來hām阮拚ngiauh-kiauh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寒--人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天氣冷吱吱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">兄弟姊妹隨个仔走去bih</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">放阮一人有話無tè講</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsiah tio̍h lim酒解憂鬱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">酒tsiah落喉　面隨紅hut-hut</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">透早</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天拍phú仔光</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日頭沓沓仔起床</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">東爿拆ha̍h</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">第一束日鬚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tshiō tī露水頂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">化做一粒一粒真珠</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蜘蛛絲kā kǹg做一kuānn phua̍h鍊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">掛tī阮ê頷頸</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">看著hiánn目koh有派頭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tann to m̄是khah早hit个</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">pì-sù兼nah-nng ê新婦仔</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">中晝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日頭赤iānn-iānn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮ê面仔hông曝kah紅ho-ho</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">打馬膠路燒kah ē tshìng煙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit个愛食豬跤ê iau鬼囡仔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kám無hōo打馬膠黏著跤</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無　怎ē走來kā阮唚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大喙leh suh阮ê花蜜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃昏</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天beh暗光--ah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮是快樂ê燈仔花</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">beh來照光台灣ê暗暝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjKYA_jcnhhyHdHuCyj5FhhEuMQHnwAMaoH0ciUGuoMtTK8S79Zt99L01iwIWzYq47E-CL1wS8mjXfc-rXihHT7RHJ2ijg93PRS7KyWnon9dHQosSt16CKWTx5N0J-8BraR_Iq-CCpefSZbwlzXEg_-PqmkFJQej1Yw1vgB13agp0Bkb_OB1StAepsc14G2/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1354%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjKYA_jcnhhyHdHuCyj5FhhEuMQHnwAMaoH0ciUGuoMtTK8S79Zt99L01iwIWzYq47E-CL1wS8mjXfc-rXihHT7RHJ2ijg93PRS7KyWnon9dHQosSt16CKWTx5N0J-8BraR_Iq-CCpefSZbwlzXEg_-PqmkFJQej1Yw1vgB13agp0Bkb_OB1StAepsc14G2/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1354%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi6on16LF7bbEzgdRXUMxzbD3ja8pr6fxNUXWPJE_hPAzwsVxdFFzODJLql